 ould Talk to Someone\nby Lori Gottlieb\nNovember 18\, 2026:\nStone Yard De
 votional\nby Charlotte Wood\nDecember 16\, 2026:\nThe Laundryman's Boy\nby
  Edward Y. C. Lee
