DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260629T193000
UID:69dd1fe5ad384e40edbaa97d@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Do you like to crochet\, embroider\, knit\, journal\, or somet
 hing else entirely? If you are looking to chat with some fellow crafters w
 hile enjoying your favourite hobby\, come join our Crafting Circle! Bring 
 your own supplies and a small project.\nAll skill levels welcome. Instruct
 ion is not provided.\nDrop in. No registration is required.
LOCATION:Oakwood Village Library and Arts Centre\, Basement Auditorium
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69dd1fe5ad384e40edbaa97d
