DESCRIPTION:Join us every month to discuss a variety of graphic novels\, c
 omics\, and manga!\nFor July we will be reading and discussing\nWe Stand o
 n Guard\nby Brian K Vaughn.\nPrint copies are available for hold at TPL.ca
 . E-book copies available on Overdrive or Hoopla through the library webs
 ite\nWe Stand on Guard\nThis program is hosted by the Arts Department
