BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Housing Help
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260519T123000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260519T163000
UID:69583000c719ac98c335c8bf@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Drop in and work one-on-one with staff from The Housing Help C
 entre (THHC) to determine your housing needs\, connect you to other govern
 ment services\, and to match you with landlords across the city. THHC work
 s with both individuals and families in the City of Toronto to find and ma
 intain affordable\, safe housing.\nTHHC can be contacted at 416-285-8070.
LOCATION:Malvern
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69583000c719ac98c335c8bf
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Adults
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Interview Preparation & Confidence Building with ACCES Employment
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260713T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260713T193000
UID:69f8fe6b703c336300256671@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:This session prepares participants to succeed in interviews wi
 th practical tools and strategies.\nParticipants will:\nLearn how to answe
 r common and behavioural interview questions\nUnderstand the STAR method f
 or structuring responses\nPractice articulating their experience with conf
 idence\nGain tips on body language\, tone\, and professional presence\nReg
 istration recommended.\nInformation Collection Notice:\nThe personal infor
 mation on this form is collected by the Toronto Public Library under the P
 ublic Libraries Act\, sections 20(a)\, 20(c)\, and 20(d). The information 
 will only be used for event and program registration\, delivery and evalua
 tion. Questions about how the library handles your information can be dire
 cted to Answerline staff at\nanswerline@tpl.ca\n\, 416-397-5981\, 789 Yong
 e Street\, Toronto ON M4W 2G8.
LOCATION:Mount Dennis
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69f8fe6b703c336300256671
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Adults
END:VEVENT
