BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Coffee & Conversation
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260520T133000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260520T143000
UID:69c7d087b48451fc3c0bc929@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Enjoy some light refreshments\, and informal discussion about 
 services in the neighbourhood. Get to know your local library staff and le
 t us know what information and resources you would like to access at the l
 ibrary and in the community.\nEach month we will be joined by a different 
 community organization.\nDrop in for some coffee\, snacks\, and a chat wit
 h library staff\, meet other library users\, and learn about local commun
 ity organizations.\nUpcoming guest organizations:\nApril 15: New Circles\n
 May 20: AWHL Senior Safety line and Ve'ahavta\nJune 17: Mosaic Home Care
LOCATION:North York Central Library\, eLearning Lab\, 2nd floor
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69c7d087b48451fc3c0bc929
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Adults
